From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath9k: shorten the ANI polling interval

Run adaptive noise immunity polling every 300 milliseconds so it reacts
more promptly to changing radio conditions.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath9k/ani.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath9k/ani.h
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@
 #define ATH9K_ANI_PERIOD                  300
 
 /* in ms */
-#define ATH9K_ANI_POLLINTERVAL            1000
+#define ATH9K_ANI_POLLINTERVAL            300
 
 #define ATH9K_SIG_FIRSTEP_SETTING_MIN     0
 #define ATH9K_SIG_FIRSTEP_SETTING_MAX     20
